@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@documentId = 1

### Create metadata (setup operation; no PDF bytes are uploaded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"invoice.pdf","contentType":"application/pdf","description":"Example"}

### List metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Get metadata (replace documentId with the returned ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

### Replace editable metadata; null clears description
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"renamed.pdf","contentType":"application/pdf","description":null}

### Validation problem
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"","contentType":"application/pdf"}

### Delete metadata
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
